        <item>
            <title>0.18.7</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 00:11:11 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.18.7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.18.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.18.7</h2>
<ul>
<li>**The confirmation, dial and intro sounds are the designed ones** — every copy now plays the same fire, dial-tick and intro sounds as the designer&#x27;s</li>
<li>**Support log names each sound** — with the diagnostic log on, every sound the app plays is recorded by name (for support)</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
